    "preamble": "Baljeet Singh And Another vs State Of Up And 3 Others on 23 July, 2024 Author: Manoj Kumar Gupta Bench: Manoj Kumar Gupta High Court Of Judicature At Allahabad ?Neutral Citation No. - 2024:Ahc:119357-Db Court No. - 21 Case :- Writ - C No. - 21285 of 2024 Petitioner :- Baljeet Singh And Another Respondent :- State Of Up And 3 Others Counsel for Petitioner :- Santosh Kumar Singh Counsel for Respondent :- C.S.C. Hon'ble Manoj Kumar Gupta,J. Hon'ble Manish Kumar Nigam,J. 1.",
    "facts": "Ballia falls under Azamgarh Region, therefore, petitioner can approach the Tribunal.",
    "arguments": "However, learned counsel for the petitioners contended before this Court on the last date that Tribunal has not been established so far and therefore, the petitioners have no other alternative remedy except to approach this Court."
